<title>AUSTRALIA: BHP approves US$141 mln Escondida expansion.</title>
<headline>BHP approves US$141 mln Escondida expansion.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP) said on Thursday that a US$141 million phase-3.5 expansion of the Escondida copper mine in Chile had been approved.</p>
</text>
